Hi [PERSON_1],

Security asked me to pass these on:

- Customer names and addresses must never be stored in the warehouse system; orders are
  referenced by order number only.
- All remote access by the vendor must use multi-factor authentication and be logged.
- The system must pass our annual penetration test; findings rated high must be fixed
  within 30 days.
- Card payment data never touches your system; payment stays in the e-commerce platform.

We have not chosen yet which cloud region the grid's control software will run in, if it
runs in the cloud at all.

